              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Tam Cuc is a Vietnamese multi-trick card game using Chinese chess cards, popular in northern Vietnam and festival play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Tam Cuc is documented as a distinct traditional card game with its own player count, equipment, and objective."
            }
          ]
        },
